    buf_bytes(out, b"`w.write_fmt(format_args(\"{x}\\n\"))?` writes formatted text (Rust's\n");
    buf_bytes(out, b"`write!`), `w.write_all(bytes)?` bytes. `env::args()` yields `&str`s\n");
    buf_bytes(out, b"(`.collect_in(gpa)`), `env::var_in(name, gpa)` a `Result<String<Gpa>,\n");
    buf_bytes(out, b"VarError>` (Rust's `env::var`), `env::current_dir_in(gpa)?`.\n");
    buf_bytes(out, b"`Command::new_in(p, gpa)`, then `.arg(a)` and `.args(list)` (they chain:\n");
    buf_bytes(out, b"`Command::new_in(\"echo\", gpa).arg(\"hi\").output()?`), `c.output()?`\n");
    buf_bytes(out, b"(`status`, `stdout`, `stderr`), `c.status()?`, `c.spawn()?`;\n");
    buf_bytes(out, b"`c.env_remove(name)`, and `c.foreground(true)`: while it waits, this\n");
